---
import CallToAction from "@/components/common/CallToAction.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <article
    class="container prose-lg mx-auto my-20 w-screen text-gray-darkest prose-headings:font-medium prose-h4:font-semibold prose-ul:list-disc prose-table:block prose-table:overflow-x-auto prose-table:rounded-3xl prose-table:border prose-table:border-gray-lighter prose-th:border prose-th:px-4 prose-th:py-2 prose-td:border prose-td:border-gray-lighter prose-td:px-4 prose-td:py-2 prose-img:rounded-xl"
  >
    <h1>About Us</h1>

    <section>
      <p>
        At FlowArc Studio, we're not just tech enthusiasts – we're innovation
        addicts who live on the cutting edge of technology. Our daily rhythm
        flows with the tech world's pulse: from catching ChatGPT announcements
        at dawn, debating Anthropic's latest breakthroughs over morning coffee,
        testing Midjourney's new features by noon, tweaking Zapier and Make
        integrations in the afternoon, to wrapping up our days diving into
        Next.js and React updates.
      </p>
      <p>
        While others are just hearing about new technologies, we're already
        turning them into real-world solutions. From state-of-the-art AI models
        and breakthrough development frameworks to revolutionary design tools –
        we're perpetually pushing the boundaries of what's possible. For us,
        creating modern websites and automating business processes isn't just
        work – it's an obsession. We're driven by the thrill of transforming
        cutting-edge technologies into powerful tools that supercharge your
        business efficiency.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Mission & Vision</h2>
      <p>
        We exist to accelerate business growth through technology while reducing
        operational costs. Our vision is to be the cornerstone partner for
        businesses navigating digital transformation, delivering solutions that
        blend technical excellence with deep business insight.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Innovation with Purpose: Every solution we create serves a clear
          business objective
        </li>
        <li>Client Partnership: Your success defines our success</li>
        <li>
          Transparent Communication: Clear, honest, and proactive dialogue at
          every step
        </li>
        <li>
          Excellence in Execution: Delivering quality that exceeds expectations
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>
        Born in 2020, FlowArc started with two visionaries - a Project Manager
        and a Full Stack Developer - tackling front-end challenges. Today, we're
        a dynamic team of 10 specialists spanning development, design, project
        management, and marketing. Our evolution into business process
        automation was driven by our clients' needs for operational efficiency.
        Each challenge we've overcome has shaped our approach to delivering
        exceptional solutions.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Team</h2>
      <p>
        Our diverse team of specialists forms the foundation of FlowArc's
        success. By combining expertise in web development, UI/UX design,
        project management, and marketing, we create solutions that address
        every aspect of your digital presence and operational needs.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Comprehensive Technology Stack: We leverage industry-leading tools
          including <a href="http://Make.com">Make.com</a>, Zapier, n8n, and
          Airtable to create powerful, scalable solutions
        </li>
        <li>
          Cost-Efficient Innovation: Our automation solutions deliver measurable
          ROI while maintaining high quality
        </li>
        <li>
          End-to-End Expertise: From web development to process automation, we
          offer complete digital transformation
        </li>
        <li>
          Client-First Approach: We build lasting partnerships focused on your
          long-term success
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
      <p>
        Your success is our priority. We don't just deliver projects; we create
        lasting solutions that grow with your business. Our support extends
        beyond project completion, ensuring your continued success in an
        evolving digital landscape.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Let's Transform Your Business</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you're looking to create a powerful web presence or streamline
        your operations through automation, FlowArc has the expertise to help
        you succeed while optimizing costs.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>📞 Contact Us: [Insert contact link or email]</li>
        <li>💬 Book Your Free Consultation: [Insert link to booking page]</li>
        <li>🌐 Discover Our Solutions: [Insert link to services page]</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
  <CallToAction
    title="Ready to Digitally Transform Your Business?"
    buttonLabel="Learn More"
  >
    <p slot="description" class="max-w-lg text-lg">
      Let's explore how FlowArc Studio can help you achieve new heights with
      cutting-edge technologies and expert solutions.
    </p>
  </CallToAction>
</Layout>
